/**
 * Integration tests: lib/stripe/refunds — refundCharge
 *
 * Stripe SDK mocked. Supabase client mocked.
 * All tests run unconditionally (no DB required).
 *
 * Coverage (9 tests):
 *  1. Happy full refund: reverse_transfer=true + refund_application_fee=true; commission_split_reverse called; release_deposit_from_session called; stripe_charges.status='refunded'
 *  2. Happy partial refund: stripe_charges.status='partially_refunded'
 *  3. INVARIANT 5: reverse_transfer: true AND refund_application_fee: true — ALWAYS present in source call
 *  4. Refund > charge amount: throws
 *  5. Refund <= 0: throws
 *  6. Capability gate fails: throws CapabilityGateError before Stripe call
 *  7. No pool drawdown originally: skips release_deposit_from_session
 *  8. Commission reversal failure: logs CRITICAL but doesn't throw (refund still completes)
 *  9. Idempotency: same logical refund retry → same idempotency key on Stripe call
 */

